    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d610">

                <pb facs="0710" n="614" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg614"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Choate.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-04-14"><hi rendition="#italic">April 14,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Agreement for Samoan commission reached on basis of Lord Salisbury’s recent
                    identical telegrams to British ambassadors in Washington and Berlin. To be
                    completed by exchange of notes at London. You will at once arrange with Lord
                    Salisbury and address him a formal note accepting on behalf of the Government of
                    the United States the joint agreement in the words of Lord Salisbury’s
                    telegrams.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
